{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1302339-things-that-would-make-it-easier-to-start","id":1302339,"title":"Things that would make it easier to start","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-03T14:31:09-07:00","id":1302339,"title":"Things that would make it easier to start","content":"If Onyx path had an overview of what books that has been published. I looked at their website and at drove thru rpg, but the books are hidden in between character sheets and charm trees and what not. At least to me it is hard to figure what is actual books and what is just a two page description of something.<br /> <br /> I followed it a lot around the first Kickstarter, but coming back to look at where third edition is at now does not feel like they are actually interested in selling the books. It feels more like a clothes store where the main displays are filled up with socks and somewhere underneath are the jackets, sweaters, etc.<br /> <br /> Am I missing somewhere where they present the main books?<br /> <br /> <br /> On a related note, have they (or someone else) made an adventure path or something more than a dungeon crawl to get new players started? It is too much for me to start a campaign from scratch. And as a result we have played some pathfinder adventure paths. Does exalted have something similar? Even if they are fan made.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Also, look at <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ow3IPUb4QtgMb1y2evMSGlJxE2VmTEOvyhJDu2eMAAo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">the exalted fan collection</a> that we are making.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/80-truemonk","name":"TrueMonk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T14:44:53-07:00","id":1302342,"title":"","content":"I know what main books are out (because there aren't many: Core, Arms, Miracles, Dragonblood) but I do find it difficult to keep track of what Hundred Devils Parade and Adversaries of the Righteous are out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T00:32:29-07:00","id":1302494,"title":"","content":"I get that they are really good at marketing their Kickstarter projects, but it just seems odd to not spend any effort at all showing off the books they have already published on their own website.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Also, look at <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ow3IPUb4QtgMb1y2evMSGlJxE2VmTEOvyhJDu2eMAAo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">the exalted fan collection</a> that we are making.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/80-truemonk","name":"TrueMonk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T04:09:21-07:00","id":1302513,"title":"","content":"Like TheWizardofOz said, there's only four books out right now: The Ex3 Core, Miracles of the Solar Exalted (All the Backer Charms for Solars from the original KS), Arms of the Chosen (Artifact book), and Dragon-Blooded: What Fire Has Wrought (How to play Dragon-Blooded, plus a bunch of lore on them). Additionally, there is the Jumpstart Tomb of Dreams, which is a summary of the Ex3 rules combined with a short adventure.<br /> <br /> Additionally, there's a whole bunch of loose Hundred Devils Night Parade and Adversaries of the Righteous articles out; these two act as Bestiary and Antagonist books, respectively, and they generally come out with a couple of articles each per month. Once all of the articles are published, both will be collected as a full book.<br /> <br /> As for what's coming:<br /> <br /> -The Realm (A setting book for the Blessed Isle and many of the Realm's satrapies): This one's due out in the coming weeks<br /> -Heirs to the Shogunate (Dragon-Blooded Backer Book; basically a whole bunch of extra &quot;stuff&quot; regarding DBs. This was compiled from the Stretch Goals from the DB Kickstarter): This one should release before the end of the year.<br /> -Lunars: Fangs at the Gate (How to play Lunars + Lunar lore and setting information): If they stay on track, this one should be fully out by this time next year. The full manuscript is written and available to backers of the Lunars KS.<br /> -Across the Eight Directions (A setting book for everywhere that isn't the Realm in Creation; successor to 1e's Scavenger Sons): Should be out some time next year<br /> -Many-Faced Strangers (Lunars Backer Book, extra &quot;stuff&quot; for Lunars made from the Stretch Goals of that KS): Also should be out next year, likely towards the end of the year<br /> -Exigents: Out of the Ashes (How to play and create Exigents; will come with full Charm creation rules. Will also contain the three &quot;optional canon&quot; Exalted being introduced this Edition: the Hearteaters, the Umbral Exalted, and the Dream-Souled): It's being written now and should be Kickstarted around this time next year.<br /> -Storyteller's Guide: Although we know this is coming, and we know it'll have QC writeups for Getimians, Infernals, and Alchemicals, that's all we know for now. Likely will be out between Exigents and Sidereals.<br /> <br /> Books that we know were pitched but not approved yet:<br /> -Towers of the Mighty (Manse creation and First Age ruins book)<br /> -Paths of Brigid (Sorcery book)<br /> -Unnamed Cults, Religions, and Spirits book<br /> <br /> After that, we also know the order of the Exalted splat books after Exigents, likely with one KS a year with Getimians and Liminals coming between the Kickstarters:<br /> -Sidereals (Will get Deluxe HC Kickstarter)<br /> -Getimians (No KS; will get a SC book after Sidereals)<br /> -Abyssals (Will get Deluxe HC Kickstarter)<br /> -Liminals (No KS, will get a SC book after Abyssals)<br /> -Infernals (Will get Deluxe HC Kickstarter)<br /> -Alchemicals (Will get Deluxe HC Kickstarter)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13008-jade-wrought-sunfire","name":"Jade-Wrought Sunfire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T15:26:32-07:00","id":1302660,"title":"","content":"Thanks a lot for the overview, it was something along those lines I thought I would be able to find on their website :-)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Also, look at <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ow3IPUb4QtgMb1y2evMSGlJxE2VmTEOvyhJDu2eMAAo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">the exalted fan collection</a> that we are making.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/80-truemonk","name":"TrueMonk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:",